{\A1;\fArial|b0|i0|c0|p34;\H0.5x;23. CONTRACTOR TO ENSURE THAT INTERIOR SHEATHING IS FLUSH, CLEAN AND FREE OF DUST AND DEFECTS BEFORE APPLICATION OF PAINT COATINGS.\P\P24. FLOOR MATERIAL TRANSITIONS OCCUR AT THE CENTERLINE OF DOORS OR FRAMED OPENINGS
  3
.\P\P25. PROVIDE ONE COAT PRIMER AND TWO FINISH COATS OF PAINT AT INTERIOR AND EXTERIOR SURFACES.\P\fLucida Grande|b0|i0|c0|p34; \P\fArial|b0|i0|c0|p34;26. ALL GLASS SHALL CONFORM WITH HUMAN IMPACT AND SAFETY  REQUIREMENTS.\P\P27. THE MINIMUM STAIRCA
  3
SE TREAD SHALL BE 10" AND THE MINIMUM RISER 7.75", WITH A MAXIMUM {\H0.7x;\S3#8;}" VARIATION WITHIN A FLIGHT.\P\P28. HANDRAILS SHALL BE LOCATED 34-38 INCHES ABOVE STAIR TREADS, AS MEASURED FROM THE NOSINGS.\P\P29. GUARDRAILS SHALL BE LOCATED ALONG AN
  3
Y FLOOR EDGES THAT DROP 30 INCHES OR MORE TO THE FLOOR OR GROUND BELOW.\P\P30. DO NOT USE SCREW-ON, NON-OPERABLE WINDOW SHUTTERS. THEY ARE AS TACKY AS CLIP-ON TIES. DO NOT USE VINYL OR ALUMINUM SIDING. THAT WOULD MAKE THIS HOUSE LOOK LIKE A CHEAP PLA
  1
STIC TOY. IT IS ABSOLUTELY FORBIDDEN. }
