{\fArial|b0|i0|c0|p34;\H0.5x;31. ALL CONSTRUCTION SHALL BE TRUE, PLUMB, LEVEL, SQUARE, AND IN PROPER ALIGNMENT.\P\P32. THE GENERAL CONTRACTOR SHALL MAINTAIN A CURRENT AND COMPLETE SET OF DRAWINGS ON THE JOB SITE DURING ALL PHASES OF CONSTRUCTION. ALL
  3
 SUBCONTRACTORS SHALL BE PROVIDED WITH A SET OF DRAWINGS.\P\fLucida Grande|b0|i0|c0|p34; \P\fArial|b0|i0|c0|p34;33. THE GENERAL CONTRACTOR SHALL VERIFY AND ASSUME RESPONSIBILITY FOR ALL DIMENSIONS AND SITE CONDITIONS, AS WELL AS INSPECT THE PREMISES 
  1
AND TAKE NOTE OF EXISTING CONDITIONS PRIOR TO SUBMITTING PRICES. NO CLAIM SHALL BE ALLOWED FOR PROBLEMS WHICH COULD HAVE BEEN PREVENTED BY A THOROUGH EXAMINATION.}
